+// ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+// STORY 8.4j — A COMPOUND LICENCE LINE IS READ WHOLE (D-8.4j.1).
+//
+// Story 8.4i taught this classifier to collect every signal ACROSS the
+// lines of a licence text. It did not teach it to read a single line
